*/

// Bullet list down the left side of talking-head footage, blacklight poster
// style. Painted space art fills a panel that fades out toward the speaker, a
// painted jellyfish drifts in it and sparkles twinkle. Each item pops in at its
// own time with a glowing neon number badge; item labels use the dark-blue
// neon lettering, with the newest item's rim in the accent colour.
